    "feasibility_escape": "escape_with_alternative",
    "quote": "Newly installed home battery systems shall support remote emergency shut-off no later than 24 months after adoption of this standard. For units already installed on the adoption date, manufacturers shall provide compatible remote shut-off capability within 72 months where technically feasible, and shall inform owners of any limitations and available alternatives."
   },
