    "quote": "When any model exceeds 8 thermal incidents per 100,000 installed units in a year, the manufacturer shall promptly notify the regulator and affected customers, submit model-specific incident data and a corrective-action plan, and provide interim precautions. A recall and remedy shall be mandatory if the plan is inadequate, is not implemented on schedule, or interim measures are insufficient to protect customers and the public."
